    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached residence available to rent short term, secluded rural setting approximately 40 minutes from Dublin and Naas, 20 minutes from Navan, Clonee and Dunshaughlin. Close access to M50,N4 commuter belt. \nThe property is  located on a private site with shared access and forms part of a cluster of family homes. As such, it would suit applicants who value privacy, low-key living and a peaceful environment. \n\nKey Features:\nFlexible rental lease on a monthly basis\nHigh Speed Fibre Wi-Fi \nBER Rating\nEco- friendly district biomass heating system,  directly from our 30acre forestry.\nSpacious parking for vans and work vehicles.\nSecure gate access only \nWashing Machines\nTumble dryers\nFully equipped Kitchen \nFully furnished \nLog burning fire place ., balcony.\nCommunal bbq area and mature garden/forestry walks on site\nLandlord management onsite"
      }
